# --- Aurora runtime artefacts ---
components/Projeto/
components/Temp/
components/Backup/
*.spf.bak
*.aurora_backup

# --- Bundled toolchain binaries ---
# These ship via GitHub Releases (see RELEASE.md). They are NOT tracked
# in git history. The bootstrap step downloads them into components/Packages/
# on first launch. If you bring your own toolchain locally, drop it in the
# matching directory and it will Just Work.
components/Packages/
saphoComponents/Packages/

# Version manifest kept by scripts/verify-components.js — per-machine record of
# which toolchain tag is installed for each component, used to detect a version
# bump on `npm install` / `npm run components:verify`. Never commit it.
components/.aurora-versions.json

# YANC compilers (cmmcomp, asmcomp, appcomp, comp2gtkw) — built from
# the separate nipscernlab/yanc repo. download-yanc.js fetches them
# from that repo's GitHub Releases at prestart, same model as the main
# toolchain bundle above.
components/bin/

# SAPHO HDL library (core.v, ula.v, processor.v, instr_dec.v, ...), the C++
# shim Headers (cmath, vector, ...) and the float-math Macros (float_sin.asm,
# ...). All three ship INSIDE the yanc release (yanc-bin-vX.zip carries bin/ +
# HDL/ + Header/ + Macros/) so they stay version-matched with the compilers
# that emit code against them. download-yanc.js extracts them; do NOT commit a
# copy that can drift stale or show up as a spurious diff after every yanc bump
# (e.g. v5.1 swapped the LUT macros for minimax — committed copies would dirty
# every dev's working tree on the next `npm start`).
components/HDL/
components/Header/
components/Macros/

# --- Dagr wordmark font (Norse, by Joël Carrouché) ---
# Free for commercial use + app embedding, but its license FORBIDS redistribution
# ("you may not make the font available for download"). So it is NOT committed —
# download-norse-font.js fetches it at bootstrap into assets/fonts/ (like the
# toolchain binaries above), and the built app embeds it.
assets/fonts/Norse.otf
assets/fonts/NORSE-LICENSE.txt

# --- Test scratch ---
coverage/
.nyc_output/

